/**
 * icse-tamil@1: OpenPath's own ICSE (CISCE second-language) Tamil course, Classes 1-10. The questions are generated by
 * tools/tamil/build_icse.py from small authored banks, so each answer is fixed by rule. Provisional content: no mastery
 * claims, only practice progress kept on the device.
 */
